High-risk=

A more advanced setup if players are confident in their ability to tank PKers to safety and are comfortable risking more and/or staying longer. None of these are required for the boss fight and may add some risk, but can be worthwhile additions for players barely failing to escape. Only bring [[Trouver parchment]] protected equipment if you are confident in your ability to escape or are willing to pay the fee on death.

* [[Royal seed pod]] or any other level 30 [[Wilderness]] teleport
* [[divine super combat potion|Divine super combat]]
* [[Blighted super restore]]s — restore magic levels drained by [[Saradomin brew]]s, restore more prayer points and are cheaper than regular [[Prayer potion]]s
* [[Saradomin brew|Saradomin brews]] for emergency food
* Rest food — [[Shark]] or better (blighted supplies are usually cheapest)
* [[Looting bag]]
* [[Dinh's bulwark]] and/or [[Dragonhide armour]] switch — greatly increase survivability against  attackers and freezes
* [[Phoenix necklace]] — emergency healing whilst tanking
* [[Anti-venom]] or [[Sanfew serum]]s — cures/prevents venom from the commonly used [[Toxic staff of the dead]]
* [[Ring of wealth (i)]] to switch at the end of the kill for increased odds of getting an [[elite clue]]
